      chk: ["Marking field size, marking time for your code + text", "Suitable materials / surfaces (test marks on real parts)", "Grade achieved and verifier standard (ISO 15415 / 29158)", "Laser class of the complete station, enclosure, extraction", "RFID: frequency, range on metal, read / write time, memory size", "Interface: Profinet / EtherNet/IP / Modbus TCP / IO-Link", "Temperature range of tags (washer up to 80 °C?)"],
